# Production Environment Variables Manifest

Copy these variables into your Coolify Project Environment settings. Ensure all values are actual production credentials, not sandbox/test keys unless explicitly intended.

```bash
# Site Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-actual-domain.com

# Supabase (SSOT)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@db.your-project.supabase.co:5432/postgres

# KajaPay (Payment)
KAJAPAY_SOURCE_KEY=your-source-key
KAJAPAY_USERNAME=your-username
KAJAPAY_PASSWORD=your-password

# Didit (Age Verification)
DIDIT_CLIENT_ID=your-didit-client-id
DIDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=your-didit-client-secret

# Zoho/Airtable (Sync)
ZOHO_CLIENT_ID=your-zoho-client-id
ZOHO_CLIENT_SECRET=your-zoho-client-secret
ZOHO_REFRESH_TOKEN=your-zoho-refresh-token
ZOHO_ORGANIZATION_ID=your-zoho-org-id
AIRTABLE_PAT=your-airtable-pat
AIRTABLE_BASE_ID=your-airtable-base-id

# AI Features
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key

# Node Environment
NODE_ENV=production
```
